{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃぁーん！みおりんこと市川美織さん(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/11/29/9838922/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有吉AKB 共和国でも共演させてもらって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日のベストヒットアーティスト2013でも共演させてもらいましたぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなんと、みおりんさんがわざわざ楽屋に来てくださって！是非お友達にと！有り難き幸せ(>_<)*♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前ブログに書いていたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューなどでもお話してたんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月は密かに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みおりんさんめっちゃ可愛いって思ってずっと応援してたんです！なので凄い嬉しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度一緒に遊びに行くとお約束しました(^-^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわく！可愛すぎる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらにさらに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃぁーん！のんちゃんこと木本花音ちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/11/29/9838922/0002.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のんちゃんとは最近お仕事でよく会います(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その度に手を振ってくれたり、ふりかえしてくれたりして内心めっちゃ喜んでます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のんちゃんも可愛すぎる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またRで会いたいな*♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HKT48さんも出演された為、らぶたんも居て、めっちゃ話しかけてくれて嬉しかった(*^^*)♪！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶたんは優しくて面白いんです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶたんとも写メ撮りたかったぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とはいいつつも、皆さん尊敬している先輩方ですのでご挨拶はしっかりいたしました(^_^)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話は変わりまして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた相方との...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/11/29/9838922/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の桜井が若月ブログに登場する率。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊エンタメでのペアグラビア企画に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井×若月で載せていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売は11月30日でございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐさん！というわけで告知をさせていただきました。すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非見てください！保存してください！キャッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、皆さんに早く会いたい若月でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/11/29/9838922/0001.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}